{"slug":"about","parent":"","title":"About Us","description":"AFSV VRC Global Development Group Ltd. develops a connected ecosystem that expands opportunity through sport, education, technology and inclusive community programming.","chrome":"overlay","front":false,"elements":[{"id":"fc99ffd1","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"about.hero","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"55204fc9","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"about-hero\" data-el=\"about.hero\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap about-hero__grid\">\n    <div class=\"about-hero__copy\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow eyebrow-rule\">About AFSV VRC</p>\n      <h1 class=\"h1 split-words\" aria-label=\"A new model for sport, learning and community development.\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:0\">A</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:1\">new</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:2\">model</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:3\">for</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:4\">sport,</span></span><br><span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:5\">learning</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:6\">and</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:7\">community</span></span><br><span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:8\"><span class=\"ink\">development.</span></span></span></span></h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">AFSV VRC Global Development Group Ltd. was formed to develop and operate a connected ecosystem that expands opportunity through sport, education, technology and inclusive community programming. Our work begins with a proposed Smart Sports Village pilot in Whitby, Ontario, and extends to partnerships and scalable initiatives in Canada, the Caribbean and global markets.</p>\n      <div class=\"btn-row btn-row--stack\"><a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"{{url:/leadership/}}\">Meet the leadership<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--line-light\" href=\"{{url:/strategic-pillars/}}\">Our strategic pillars<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"collage\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"collage__a\"><div class=\"pmedia\" data-parallax=\"0.05\"><img src=\"{{asset:img/life/plaza.jpg}}\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"752\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"collage__b\"><div class=\"pmedia\" data-parallax=\"0.12\"><img src=\"{{asset:img/life/hall.jpg}}\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"752\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"collage__c\"><div class=\"pmedia\" data-parallax=\"0.18\"><img src=\"{{asset:img/life/lounge.jpg}}\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"752\"></div></div>\n      <span class=\"collage__ring\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"2800f006","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"about.mission-vision","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"51a4522b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"about.mission-vision\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"mv\">\n    <article class=\"mv__card reveal\">\n      <span class=\"mv__label\">Mission</span>\n      <p class=\"mv__text\">To create accessible, technology-enabled environments and pathways that develop athletes, strengthen academic and life outcomes, support diverse learners, and generate lasting value for families and communities.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"mv__card mv__card--dark reveal\">\n      <span class=\"mv__label\">Vision</span>\n      <p class=\"mv__text\">A global network of smart sports villages and connected programs where talent is developed, learning is supported, inclusion is designed in, and communities share in the benefits of sport-led development.</p>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"95f49466","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"about.story","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"279fb81c","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"about.story\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <div class=\"section-head reveal\"><h2 class=\"h2\">From a belief to a network.</h2><p class=\"body-lg muted\">How the AFSV VRC model grows, from its founding idea to the proposed Whitby pilot and the planned network beyond it.</p></div>\n    <ol class=\"timeline\" data-timeline>\n      \n      <li class=\"timeline__step\" style=\"--i:0\">\n        <span class=\"timeline__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span class=\"timeline__k\">The belief</span>\n        <h3 class=\"timeline__t\">Sport can transform communities</h3>\n        <p>when it is combined with education, technology and opportunity.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"timeline__step\" style=\"--i:1\">\n        <span class=\"timeline__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span class=\"timeline__k\">The ecosystem</span>\n        <h3 class=\"timeline__t\">AFSVHCL™</h3>\n        <p>An integrated platform combining sports science, education programs, esports engagement and community participation.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"timeline__step\" style=\"--i:2\">\n        <span class=\"timeline__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span class=\"timeline__k\">The pilot</span>\n        <h3 class=\"timeline__t\">Whitby Smart Sports Village</h3>\n        <p>A proposed year-round, technology-enabled destination in Whitby, Ontario.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"timeline__step\" style=\"--i:3\">\n        <span class=\"timeline__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span class=\"timeline__k\">The network</span>\n        <h3 class=\"timeline__t\">Canada, the Caribbean and beyond</h3>\n        <p>A national network of multi-sport dome facilities and scalable initiatives in global markets.</p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"72e8fa17","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"about.model","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"9c28ed44","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"about.model\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <h2 class=\"h2 mb-l reveal\">What makes the model different.</h2>\n  <div class=\"model\" data-stagger>\n    \n    <div class=\"model__item\">\n      <svg class=\"model__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"3.2\"/><path d=\"M5 20c.6-3.8 3.4-6 7-6s6.4 2.2 7 6\"/><path d=\"M12 14v3\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"num\">01</span>\n      <h3>Whole-person development</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"model__item\">\n      <svg class=\"model__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M12 4v16\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"num\">02</span>\n      <h3>Inclusive by design</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"model__item\">\n      <svg class=\"model__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 20h18M6 20V9l6-5 6 5v11\"/><path d=\"M10 20v-5h4v5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"num\">03</span>\n      <h3>Smart infrastructure</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"model__item\">\n      <svg class=\"model__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"num\">04</span>\n      <h3>Partnership-led delivery</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"model__item\">\n      <svg class=\"model__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 18l5-6 4 3 7-9\"/><path d=\"M15 6h5v5\"/></svg>\n      <span class=\"num\">05</span>\n      <h3>Scalable impact</h3>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"69f64d06","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"about.six-pillars","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"3da8dab3","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"about.six-pillars\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Our ecosystem</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">Six pillars. One vision.</h2>\n    <p class=\"body-lg muted\">AFSVHCL™ is not another sports facility — it is the ecosystem that makes every sports club, academy and institution better.</p>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"kgrid kgrid--3\" data-stagger>\n    <article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.6 18.6h18.8\"/><path d=\"M4 18.6C4 12 7.6 7.4 12 7.4S20 12 20 18.6\"/><path d=\"M8.2 18.6c0-4.8 1.7-8.6 3.8-11.2M15.8 18.6c0-4.8-1.7-8.6-3.8-11.2\"/><path d=\"M4.8 14.2h14.4\"/><path d=\"M10.4 18.6v-2.8h3.2v2.8\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Smart Sports Infrastructure</h3>\n      <p>Proposed year-round multi-sport dome facilities designed to remove the seasonal limits that restrict Canadian athletes.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 6.6C9.8 5 6.6 4.6 3.4 5v13.4c3.2-.4 6.4 0 8.6 1.6 2.2-1.6 5.4-2 8.6-1.6V5c-3.2-.4-6.4 0-8.6 1.6z\"/><path d=\"M12 6.6v13.4\"/><path d=\"M15.8 10.4c.6-1 2.4-.8 2.4.6 0 1.2-2.4 2.6-2.4 2.6s-2.4-1.4-2.4-2.6c0-1.4 1.8-1.6 2.4-.6z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Education &amp; Inclusion</h3>\n      <p>Integrated academic support, mentorship and neurodivergent programming through MLMSR Mentorship LLC.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6.6 7.6h10.8a3.6 3.6 0 0 1 3.5 2.8l1 4.6a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-4 2.2l-2.1-2.2H8.2L6.1 17.2a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-4-2.2l1-4.6a3.6 3.6 0 0 1 3.5-2.8z\"/><path d=\"M7.4 10.2v3M5.9 11.7h3\"/><circle cx=\"15.6\" cy=\"11\" r=\".9\"/><circle cx=\"17.6\" cy=\"12.8\" r=\".9\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Esports &amp; Digital Media</h3>\n      <p>A digital ecosystem connecting athletes and fans through esports, live streaming and interactive media via EFN.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.6\"/><path d=\"M3.4 12h17.2\"/><path d=\"M12 3.4c2.4 2.4 3.6 5.2 3.6 8.6s-1.2 6.2-3.6 8.6c-2.4-2.4-3.6-5.2-3.6-8.6s1.2-6.2 3.6-8.6z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Global Diaspora Network</h3>\n      <p>Connecting Canada&#39;s multicultural communities worldwide to support youth development and community empowerment.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.6 12.4l3.6-4.2 3.6 1.4 2.4-1.4 3.2.4 3.8 3.6\"/><path d=\"M2.6 12.4l3.4 3.2M21.4 12.2l-3.2 3.4\"/><path d=\"M8.6 14.6l1.6 1.6a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.7 0l.2-.2M11 13.4l2.4 2.4a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.7 0l.6-.6-3.6-3.8\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Corporate &amp; Institutional Partnerships</h3>\n      <p>Public-private partnerships with municipalities, post-secondary institutions, school boards and corporate sponsors.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3.4 20.4h17.2\"/><path d=\"M5.6 20.4v-4.6M10 20.4v-7.4M14.4 20.4v-5.6M18.8 20.4V9.4\"/><path d=\"M4.6 11.6l5-4.4 4 2.8 6.2-5.6\"/><path d=\"M16.4 4.4h3.4v3.4\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Scalable National Model</h3>\n      <p>The pilot is designed as the foundation for a national rollout — replicable across Canada and internationally.</p>\n      \n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"30a8b5d5","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"about.values","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"e9fb9054","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--navy\" data-el=\"about.values\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <div class=\"section-head reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Our core values</p><h2 class=\"h2\">What drives us.</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"values\" data-stagger>\n      <article class=\"value\"><span>01</span><h3>Athlete First</h3><p>Every decision centres on the athlete’s development, wellbeing and future.</p></article><article class=\"value\"><span>02</span><h3>Inclusion</h3><p>Every child, regardless of ability, background or circumstance, deserves access to sport and education.</p></article><article class=\"value\"><span>03</span><h3>Innovation</h3><p>We build what doesn’t yet exist — infrastructure, programs and platforms that reimagine what’s possible.</p></article><article class=\"value\"><span>04</span><h3>Community Impact</h3><p>We measure success not just in revenue, but in lives changed and communities strengthened.</p></article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"2a6f07fe","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"about.mission-statement","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"6066c0b3","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"mission-band\" data-el=\"about.mission-statement\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-m\">Our mission</p>\n    <p class=\"mission-band__words\" data-sweep>Educate. Empower. Include. Inspire.</p>\n    <p class=\"lead\">To establish a national sports ecosystem blending athlete development, education, esports and community impact through smart infrastructure — serving athletes, families and communities across Canada and beyond.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"ff0e8165","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"about.founder","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"717cb9c3","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"founder\" data-el=\"about.founder\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section founder__grid\">\n    <figure class=\"founder__photo wipe\">\n      <img src=\"{{asset:img/martin-lashley.jpg}}\" alt=\"Martin Lashley standing on the turf inside an indoor sports dome.\" width=\"940\" height=\"1224\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <figcaption><b>Martin Lashley</b>Founder, Chairman &amp; Interim CEO</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <div class=\"founder__copy reveal\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Founder story</p>\n      <blockquote class=\"founder__quote\">“We are not building a sports facility. We are building an ecosystem — one that will change the trajectory of thousands of young lives and strengthen communities across Canada and the world.”</blockquote>\n      <p class=\"body-lg\">Recognizing the challenges athletes face in Canada's climate, Martin Lashley envisioned a network of high-performance indoor sports environments capable of supporting year-round training while delivering mentorship, academic support and career pathways for young people.</p>\n      <p class=\"founder__sign\">Building Today. Inspiring Tomorrow.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"{{url:/leadership/#martin-lashley}}\">Read the founder profile<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"1d8aff65","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"about.leadership","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"4a790d64","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"about.leadership\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"section-head reveal\"><h2 class=\"h2\">The leadership team.</h2><p class=\"body-lg muted\">The people guiding governance, operations and investment across AFSVHCL. <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"{{url:/leadership/}}\">Full profiles <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></p></div>\n  <div class=\"team\" data-stagger>\n    \n    <a class=\"team-card\" href=\"{{url:/leadership/#martin-lashley}}\">\n      <div class=\"portrait team-card__photo\"><img src=\"{{asset:img/martin-lashley.jpg}}\" alt=\"Martin Lashley standing on the turf inside an indoor sports dome.\" width=\"940\" height=\"1224\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <span class=\"team-card__body\">\n        <span class=\"team-card__role\">Founder, Chairman &amp; Interim CEO</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__name\">Martin Lashley</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__short\">Founded AFSVHCL on a singular belief: sport can transform communities when combined with education, technology and opportunity.</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__go\">View profile <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></span>\n      </span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"team-card\" href=\"{{url:/leadership/#natalie-sutherland-lashley}}\">\n      <div class=\"portrait team-card__photo\"><img src=\"{{asset:img/leaders/natalie-sutherland-lashley.jpg}}\" alt=\"Portrait of Natalie Sutherland-Lashley, smiling, in a black turtleneck.\" width=\"940\" height=\"1224\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <span class=\"team-card__body\">\n        <span class=\"team-card__role\">Co-Chairperson &amp; Corporate Secretary</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__name\">Natalie Sutherland-Lashley</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__short\">Guides governance, corporate structure and the strategic relationships behind AFSVHCL’s expansion across Canada and the Caribbean.</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__go\">View profile <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></span>\n      </span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"team-card\" href=\"{{url:/leadership/#michelle-lashley}}\">\n      <div class=\"portrait team-card__photo\"><img src=\"{{asset:img/leaders/michelle-lashley.jpg}}\" alt=\"Portrait of Michelle Lashley in a navy blazer in an office.\" width=\"940\" height=\"1224\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <span class=\"team-card__body\">\n        <span class=\"team-card__role\">Chief Operating Officer (COO)</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__name\">Michelle Lashley</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__short\">Turns the vision into an operating ecosystem — leading operations, partnerships and program delivery across Canada, the Caribbean and the US.</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__go\">View profile <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></span>\n      </span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"team-card\" href=\"{{url:/leadership/#vinai-charran}}\">\n      <div class=\"portrait team-card__photo\"><img src=\"{{asset:img/leaders/vinai-charran.jpg}}\" alt=\"Portrait of Vinai Charran in a charcoal suit and red tie.\" width=\"940\" height=\"1224\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <span class=\"team-card__body\">\n        <span class=\"team-card__role\">Chief Investor, AFSVHCL · Founder &amp; CEO, Charran&#39;s Group of Companies</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__name\">Vinai Charran</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__short\">Leads strategic investment and capital growth, drawing on decades building businesses across retail, education, publishing and trade.</span>\n        <span class=\"team-card__go\">View profile <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></span>\n      </span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"84537f93","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"cta.band","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"7e79e536","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"cta-band\" data-el=\"cta.band\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band__inner band--navy\">\n      <span class=\"cta-band__glow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <h2 class=\"reveal\">Connect with our team.</h2>\n      <div class=\"btn-row btn-row--stack\"><a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"{{url:/contact/}}\">Connect With Our Team<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--line-light\" href=\"{{url:/partners/}}\">Partner with us<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]}]}